From: ViKing <viking.yfy@qq.com>
Date: Sun, 25 Oct 2026 14:06:01 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] wifi: libertas: publish the permanent MAC address

Set the wiphy permanent address from the device MAC address so userspace
can identify the wireless hardware.

Original author was not recorded in the imported patch.
[viking.yfy@qq.com: complete imported patch metadata]
Signed-off-by: ViKing <viking.yfy@qq.com>
---
--- a/drivers/net/wireless/marvell/libertas/cfg.c
+++ b/drivers/net/wireless/marvell/libertas/cfg.c
@@ -2182,6 +2182,8 @@ int lbs_cfg_register(struct lbs_private
 	wdev->wiphy->n_cipher_suites = ARRAY_SIZE(cipher_suites);
 	wdev->wiphy->reg_notifier = lbs_reg_notifier;
 
+	memcpy(wdev->wiphy->perm_addr, priv->current_addr, ETH_ALEN);
+
 	ret = wiphy_register(wdev->wiphy);
 	if (ret < 0)
 		pr_err("cannot register wiphy device\n");
